{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Sandrax-66b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmos Colonisation Corp\u2122 grants you the opportunity to become a pioneer of the planet Sandrax-66b.<br>An unknown world, mysterious creatures, strange flora\u2026 and humans who clearly should not be here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a camp before nightfall. At night, certain creatures will begin to attack you. Try to collect as much data about them as possible. Optionally - survive.<br>We have invested significant resources in your transportation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/0adb25bf61aa408d07df97d03927f496.poster.avif?t=1770995137\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/0adb25bf61aa408d07df97d03927f496.webm?t=1770995137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/0adb25bf61aa408d07df97d03927f496.mp4?t=1770995137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Expedition Did Not Go According to Plan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did your ship explode in orbit? Did the landing happen \u201chowever it happened\u201d? That occurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather enough valuable data and samples - and perhaps we will return for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In exchange for your reports, the corporation provides technologies and blueprints to increase your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/e5f2d5dfbdb2f43600eb4be618d388fc.poster.avif?t=1770995137\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/e5f2d5dfbdb2f43600eb4be618d388fc.webm?t=1770995137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/e5f2d5dfbdb2f43600eb4be618d388fc.mp4?t=1770995137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nighthold - Your Base and Your Way to Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night is the ultimate test of your decisions. Stay away from the ground. Seriously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The optimal solution is to build a stilted shelter: <strong>Nighthold</strong>.<br>Fortify it, adapt it to new threats, and prepare for the next night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/5f597cbadd53ae90c7cacaca1b4ff408.poster.avif?t=1770995137\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/5f597cbadd53ae90c7cacaca1b4ff408.webm?t=1770995137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/5f597cbadd53ae90c7cacaca1b4ff408.mp4?t=1770995137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Without Restrictions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you see can be dismantled, destroyed, or set on fire.<br>Fire spreads freely, gets out of control, and is equally dangerous to everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/d57a9c4593caa0284db587bb8dedc383.poster.avif?t=1770995137\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/d57a9c4593caa0284db587bb8dedc383.webm?t=1770995137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/d57a9c4593caa0284db587bb8dedc383.mp4?t=1770995137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Problem Has Multiple Solutions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmos Colonisation Corp\u2122 values not only strength, but ingenuity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may sneak, attack head-on, open the gates at night and let the environment decide the outcome\u2026 or simply burn everything to the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The corporation supports any approach. Ethical evaluation is not part of the mandatory report.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/9df577052a964e2451de6b815f4b7e1e.poster.avif?t=1770995137\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/9df577052a964e2451de6b815f4b7e1e.webm?t=1770995137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/9df577052a964e2451de6b815f4b7e1e.mp4?t=1770995137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Is More Efficient Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may not be the only survivor. Contact others via radio and work together in online co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters offer different roles and perks. Team play provides tactical advantages and allows you to collect twice as much valuable data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3376960?t=1770995137","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.